  "description": "Creatures pour out of the Murk and march on the kingdom of Solva-Tino-Marko. Raise the three founders' towers beside the road, link them into a Crown, and keep the gate. Fifty stages of ten waves, each on its own ground and each with a creature you haven't met, from the first Gloop to the Murk King. Arrow posts, barricades, a Viking warband and the Wizard Stream; seasons and weather that change the battle; coins and chests to tap up for your bank. No ads, no accounts, plays offline.",
